.SH NAME
le-list - Print a one-shot table of listeners (no TUI)


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBle list [filter] [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Print every localhost listener as a table (or JSON). An optional
filter narrows it to rows matching that text in the port, name,
command, folder, or owner — the same match the TUI's / filter uses.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for list

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	output as JSON


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBle(1)\fP


